</tbody></table>

<p id="mwAfI">Wolfe also amassed a long list of nominations in years when he did not win, including sixteen Nebula award nominations and eight <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hugo_Award" title="Hugo Award" id="mwAfM">Hugo Award</a> nominations.<sup about="#mwt184" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-53" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-53"}}'><a href="#cite_note-53" id="mwAfQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAfU"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAfY">[</span>50<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAfc">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

</section></section><section data-mw-section-id="6" id="mwAfg" aria-labelledby="Works"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Works">Works</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Gene_Wolfe&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6" title="Edit section: Works"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt185" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAfk" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"main","href":"./Template:Main"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Gene Wolfe bibliography"}},"i":0}}]}'><style data-mw-deduplicate="TemplateStyles:r1368532237" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" about="#mwt186" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Hatnote/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'>.mw-parser-output .hatnote{font-style:italic}.mw-parser-output div.hatnote{padding-left:1.6em;margin-bottom:0.5em}.mw-parser-output .hatnote i{font-style:normal}.mw-parser-output .hatnote+.mw-empty-elt+.hatnote{margin-top:-0.5em}@media print{body.ns-0 .mw-parser-output .hatnote{display:none!important}}</style></span><div role="note" class="hatnote navigation-not-searchable" about="#mwt185" id="mwAfo">Main article: <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gene_Wolfe_bibliography" title="Gene Wolfe bibliography">Gene Wolfe bibliography</a></div>

<p id="mwAfs">This is a partial list of works by Wolfe, focusing on those which won awards.</p>

<section data-mw-section-id="7" id="mwAfw" aria-labelledby="Novels"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Novels">Novels</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Gene_Wolfe&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7" title="Edit section: Novels"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<ul id="mwAf0"><li id="mwAf4"><i id="mwAf8"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Book_of_the_New_Sun" title="The Book of the New Sun" id="mwAgA">The Book of the New Sun</a></i>
<ul id="mwAgE"><li id="mwAgI"><i id="mwAgM"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Shadow_of_the_Torturer" title="The Shadow of the Torturer" id="mwAgQ">The Shadow of the Torturer</a></i> (1980) BSFA Award &amp; World Fantasy Award winner, 1981;<sup about="#mwt189" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-worldswithoutend1982_54-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"worldswithoutend1982"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-worldswithoutend1982-54"}}'><a href="#cite_note-worldswithoutend1982-54" id="mwAgU"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAgY"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAgc">[</span>51<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAgg">]</span></span></a></sup> Nebula Award and John W. Campbell Award nominee, 1981<sup about="#mwt190" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-worldswithoutend1981_46-3" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"worldswithoutend1981"}}'><a href="#cite_note-worldswithoutend1981-46" id="mwAgk"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAgo"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAgs">[</span>43<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAgw">]</span></span></a></sup></li>
<li id="mwAg0"><i id="mwAg4"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Claw_of_the_Conciliator" title="The Claw of the Conciliator" id="mwAg8">The Claw of the Conciliator</a></i> (1981) Nebula and Locus Fantasy winner, 1982; Hugo and World Fantasy Awards nominated, 1982<sup about="#mwt191" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-worldswithoutend1982_54-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"worldswithoutend1982"}}'><a href="#cite_note-worldswithoutend1982-54" id="mwAhA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAhE"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAhI">[</span>51<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAhM">]</span></span></a></sup></li>
<li id="mwAhQ"><i id="mwAhU"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Sword_of_the_Lictor" title="The Sword of the Lictor" id="mwAhY">The Sword of the Lictor</a></i> (1982) Locus Fantasy and BFS Winner, 1983; Nebula and BSFA Awards nominee, 1982<sup about="#mwt192" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-worldswithoutend1982_54-2" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"worldswithoutend1982"}}'><a href="#cite_note-worldswithoutend1982-54" id="mwAhc"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAhg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAhk">[</span>51<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAho">]</span></span></a></sup> Hugo and World Fantasy Awards nominee, 1983<sup about="#mwt193" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-worldswithoutend1983_47-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"worldswithoutend1983"}}'><a href="#cite_note-worldswithoutend1983-47" id="mwAhs"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAhw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAh0">[</span>44<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAh4">]</span></span></a></sup></li>
<li id="mwAh8"><i id="mwAiA"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Citadel_of_the_Autarch" title="The Citadel of the Autarch" id="mwAiE">The Citadel of the Autarch</a></i> (1983) John W. Campbell award winner, Nebula and BSFA nominee, 1984;<sup about="#mwt194" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-worldswithoutend1984_48-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"worldswithoutend1984"}}'><a href="#cite_note-worldswithoutend1984-48" id="mwAiI"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAiM"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAiQ">[</span>45<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAiU">]</span></span></a></sup> Locus Fantasy nominee, 1983<sup about="#mwt195" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-worldswithoutend1983_47-2" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"worldswithoutend1983"}}'><a href="#cite_note-worldswithoutend1983-47" id="mwAiY"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAic"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAig">[</span>44<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAik">]</span></span></a></sup></li></ul></li>
<li id="mwAio"><i id="mwAis"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Free_Live_Free" title="Free Live Free" id="mwAiw">Free Live Free</a></i> (1984) BSFA nominee, 1985;<sup about="#mwt198" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-55" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-55"}}'><a href="#cite_note-55" id="mwAi0"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAi4"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAi8">[</span>52<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAjA">]</span></span></a></sup> Nebula nominee, 1986<sup about="#mwt201" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-56" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-56"}}'><a href="#cite_note-56" id="mwAjE"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAjI"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAjM">[</span>53<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAjQ">]</span></span></a></sup></li>
<li id="mwAjU"><i id="mwAjY"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Urth_of_the_New_Sun" title="The Urth of the New Sun" id="mwAjc">The Urth of the New Sun</a></i> (1987) Hugo, Nebula, and Locus SF Awards nominee, 1988<sup about="#mwt204" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-worldswithoutend1988_57-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"worldswithoutend1988"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-worldswithoutend1988-57"}}'><a href="#cite_note-worldswithoutend1988-57" id="mwAjg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAjk"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAjo">[</span>54<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAjs">]</span></span></a></sup></li>
<li id="mwAjw">The <i id="mwAj0">Soldier</i> series
<ul id="mwAj4"><li id="mwAj8"><i id="mwAkA"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Soldier_of_the_Mist" title="Soldier of the Mist" id="mwAkE">Soldier of the Mist</a></i> (1986) Locus Fantasy winner, WFA nominee, 1987;<sup about="#mwt205" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-worldswithoutend1987_49-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"worldswithoutend1987"}}'><a href="#cite_note-worldswithoutend1987-49" id="mwAkI"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAkM"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAkQ">[</span>46<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAkU">]</span></span></a></sup> Nebula nominee 1988<sup about="#mwt206" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-worldswithoutend1988_57-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"worldswithoutend1988"}}'><a href="#cite_note-worldswithoutend1988-57" id="mwAkY"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAkc"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAkg">[</span>54<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAkk">]</span></span></a></sup></li>
<li id="mwAko"><i id="mwAks"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Soldier_of_Arete" title="Soldier of Arete" id="mwAkw">Soldier of Arete</a></i> (1989) Locus Fantasy and WFA nominee, 1990<sup about="#mwt209" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-58" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-58"}}'><a href="#cite_note-58" id="mwAk0"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAk4"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAk8">[</span>55<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAlA">]</span></span></a></sup></li>
<li id="mwAlE"><i id="mwAlI"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Soldier_of_Sidon" title="Soldier of Sidon" id="mwAlM">Soldier of Sidon</a></i> (2006) World Fantasy Award winner, Locus Fantasy Award nominee, 2007<sup about="#mwt210" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-worldswithoutend2007_50-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"worldswithoutend2007"}}'><a href="#cite_note-worldswithoutend2007-50" id="mwAlQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAlU"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAlY">[</span>47<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAlc">]</span></span></a></sup></li></ul></li>
