</section><section data-mw-section-id="8" id="mwArE" aria-labelledby="Story_collections"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Story_collections">Story collections</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Gene_Wolfe&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8" title="Edit section: Story collections"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<ul id="mwArI"><li id="mwArM"><i id="mwArQ"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Island_of_Doctor_Death_and_Other_Stories_and_Other_Stories" title="The Island of Doctor Death and Other Stories and Other Stories" id="mwArU">The Island of Doctor Death and Other Stories and Other Stories</a></i> (1980) (The title story is "The Island of Doctor Death and Other Stories". Among others, the collection also includes "The Death of Dr. Island" and "The Doctor of Death Island". "The Death of Dr. Island" won the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nebula_Award" title="Nebula Award" id="mwArY">Nebula Award</a> for <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nebula_Award_for_Best_Novella" title="Nebula Award for Best Novella" id="mwArc">Best Novella</a>.)</li>
<li id="mwArg"><i id="mwArk"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gene_Wolfe's_Book_of_Days" title="Gene Wolfe's Book of Days" id="mwAro">Gene Wolfe's Book of Days</a></i> (1981)</li>
<li id="mwArs"><i id="mwArw"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Storeys_from_the_Old_Hotel" title="Storeys from the Old Hotel" id="mwAr0">Storeys from the Old Hotel</a></i> (1988) (winner of the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/World_Fantasy_Award" title="World Fantasy Award" id="mwAr4">World Fantasy Award</a> for best collection)</li>
<li id="mwAr8"><i id="mwAsA">Endangered Species</i> (1989)</li>
<li id="mwAsE"><i id="mwAsI">Castle of Days</i> (1995)</li>
<li id="mwAsM"><i id="mwAsQ">Strange Travelers</i> (2001)</li>
<li id="mwAsU"><i id="mwAsY"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Innocents_Aboard" title="Innocents Aboard" id="mwAsc">Innocents Aboard</a></i> (2005)</li>
<li id="mwAsg"><i id="mwAsk"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Starwater_Strains" title="Starwater Strains" id="mwAso">Starwater Strains</a></i> (2006)</li>
<li id="mwAss"><i id="mwAsw">The Best of Gene Wolfe</i> (2010)</li>
<li id="mwAs0"><i id="mwAs4">The Dead Man and Other Horror Stories</i> (2023)</li></ul>

</section></section><section data-mw-section-id="9" id="mwAs8" aria-labelledby="Books_about_Gene_Wolfe"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Books_about_Gene_Wolfe">Books about Gene Wolfe</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Gene_Wolfe&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9" title="Edit section: Books about Gene Wolfe"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<ul id="mwAtA"><li id="mwAtE"><i id="mwAtI">Gene Wolfe (Starmont Reader's Guide, 29)</i>: Joan Gordon (Borgo Press, 1986, <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt236" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAtM" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"ISBN","href":"./Template:ISBN"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"978-0930261191"}},"i":0}}]}'/><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISBN_(identifier)" title="ISBN (identifier)" about="#mwt236" class="mw-redirect">ISBN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt236"> </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-0930261191" title="Special:BookSources/978-0930261191" about="#mwt236" id="mwAtQ"><bdi>978-0930261191</bdi></a>; reprinted as a Special Publication of the Monterey Bay Aquarium Foundation, 2008, <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt238" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAtU" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"ISBN","href":"./Template:ISBN"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"978-0930261184"}},"i":0}}]}'/><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISBN_(identifier)" title="ISBN (identifier)" about="#mwt238" class="mw-redirect">ISBN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt238"> </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-0930261184" title="Special:BookSources/978-0930261184" about="#mwt238" id="mwAtY"><bdi>978-0930261184</bdi></a>), an annotated bibliography and criticism on Wolfe's science fiction and non-fiction writing</li>
<li id="mwAtc"><i id="mwAtg">The Wizard Knight Companion: A Lexicon for Gene Wolfe's The Knight and The Wizard</i>: Michael Andre-Driussi (Sirius Fiction, 2009, <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt240" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAtk" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"ISBN","href":"./Template:ISBN"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"978-0-9642795-3-7"}},"i":0}}]}'/><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISBN_(identifier)" title="ISBN (identifier)" about="#mwt240" class="mw-redirect">ISBN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt240"> </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-0-9642795-3-7" title="Special:BookSources/978-0-9642795-3-7" about="#mwt240" id="mwAto"><bdi>978-0-9642795-3-7</bdi></a>), a dictionary of words and names from Wolfe's <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Wizard_Knight" title="The Wizard Knight" id="mwAts">Wizard Knight</a> novels</li>
<li id="mwAtw"><i id="mwAt0">Lexicon Urthus</i>: Michael Andre-Druissi (Sirius Fiction, 1994, <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt242" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAt4" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"ISBN","href":"./Template:ISBN"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"0-9642795-9-2"}},"i":0}}]}'/><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISBN_(identifier)" title="ISBN (identifier)" about="#mwt242" class="mw-redirect">ISBN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt242"> </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-9642795-9-2" title="Special:BookSources/0-9642795-9-2" about="#mwt242" id="mwAt8"><bdi>0-9642795-9-2</bdi></a>), a dictionary of the archaic words used by Wolfe in <i id="mwAuA">The Book of the New Sun</i></li>
<li id="mwAuE"><i id="mwAuI">The Long and the Short of It: More Essays on the Fiction of Gene Wolfe</i>: Robert Borski (iUniverse, Inc., 2006, <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt244" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAuM" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"ISBN","href":"./Template:ISBN"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"978-0-595-38645-1"}},"i":0}}]}'/><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISBN_(identifier)" title="ISBN (identifier)" about="#mwt244" class="mw-redirect">ISBN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt244"> </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-0-595-38645-1" title="Special:BookSources/978-0-595-38645-1" about="#mwt244" id="mwAuQ"><bdi>978-0-595-38645-1</bdi></a>)</li>
<li id="mwAuU"><i id="mwAuY">Solar Labyrinth: Exploring Gene Wolfe's "Book of the New Sun"</i>: Robert Borski (iUniverse, Inc., 2004, <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt246" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAuc" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"ISBN","href":"./Template:ISBN"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"978-0-595-31729-5"}},"i":0}}]}'/><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISBN_(identifier)" title="ISBN (identifier)" about="#mwt246" class="mw-redirect">ISBN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt246"> </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-0-595-31729-5" title="Special:BookSources/978-0-595-31729-5" about="#mwt246" id="mwAug"><bdi>978-0-595-31729-5</bdi></a>)</li>
<li id="mwAuk"><i id="mwAuo">Attending Daedalus: Gene Wolfe, Artifice, and the Reader</i>: Peter Wright (Liverpool University Press, 2003, <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt248" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAus" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"ISBN","href":"./Template:ISBN"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"0-85323-818-9"}},"i":0}}]}'/><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISBN_(identifier)" title="ISBN (identifier)" about="#mwt248" class="mw-redirect">ISBN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt248"> </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-85323-818-9" title="Special:BookSources/0-85323-818-9" about="#mwt248" id="mwAuw"><bdi>0-85323-818-9</bdi></a>): Study of <i id="mwAu0">The Book of the New Sun</i> and <i id="mwAu4">The Urth of the New Sun</i></li>
<li id="mwAu8"><i id="mwAvA">Shadows of the New Sun: Wolfe on Writing / Writers on Wolfe</i>: Peter Wright (Liverpool University Press, 2007, <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt250" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAvE" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"ISBN","href":"./Template:ISBN"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"978-1-84631-058-4"}},"i":0}}]}'/><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISBN_(identifier)" title="ISBN (identifier)" about="#mwt250" class="mw-redirect">ISBN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt250"> </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-1-84631-058-4" title="Special:BookSources/978-1-84631-058-4" about="#mwt250" id="mwAvI"><bdi>978-1-84631-058-4</bdi></a>)</li>
<li id="mwAvM"><i id="mwAvQ">Strokes</i>: John Clute (Serconia Press, 1988, <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt252" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAvU" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"ISBN","href":"./Template:ISBN"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"0-934933-03-0"}},"i":0}}]}'/><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISBN_(identifier)" title="ISBN (identifier)" about="#mwt252" class="mw-redirect">ISBN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt252"> </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-934933-03-0" title="Special:BookSources/0-934933-03-0" about="#mwt252" id="mwAvY"><bdi>0-934933-03-0</bdi></a>)</li>
<li id="mwAvc"><i id="mwAvg">Gene Wolfe: An annotated bibliography and criticism on Wolfe's science fiction and non-fiction writing</i>: Joan Gordon (Borgo Press, 2008, <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt254" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAvk" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"ISBN","href":"./Template:ISBN"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"0-930261-18-6"}},"i":0}}]}'/><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISBN_(identifier)" title="ISBN (identifier)" about="#mwt254" class="mw-redirect">ISBN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt254"> </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-930261-18-6" title="Special:BookSources/0-930261-18-6" about="#mwt254" id="mwAvo"><bdi>0-930261-18-6</bdi></a>)</li>
<li id="mwAvs"><i id="mwAvw">Gate of Horn, Book of Silk: A Guide to Gene Wolfe's The Book of the Long Sun and The Book of the Short Sun</i>: Michael Andre-Driussi (Sirius Fiction, 2012, <link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt256" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwAv0" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"ISBN","href":"./Template:ISBN"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"0-964279-55-X"}},"i":0}}]}'/><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISBN_(identifier)" title="ISBN (identifier)" about="#mwt256" class="mw-redirect">ISBN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt256"> </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-964279-55-X" title="Special:BookSources/0-964279-55-X" about="#mwt256" id="mwAv4"><bdi>0-964279-55-X</bdi></a>)</li>
<li id="mwAv8"><i id="mwAwA">Shadows of the New Sun</i>, an anthology of stories by other authors which are all explicitly based on Wolfe stories (TOR Books, 2013)</li>
<li id="mwAwE"><i id="mwAwI">Between Light and Shadow: An Exploration of the Fiction of Gene Wolfe, 1951-1986</i>: Marc Aramini (Castalia House, 2015, ASIN B011YTDGY2), a comprehensive literary analysis of Wolfe's fiction from 1951 to 1986, volume 1 of 2.</li></ul>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="10" id="mwAwM" aria-labelledby="Film_adaptations"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Film_adaptations">Film adaptations</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Gene_Wolfe&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10" title="Edit section: Film adaptations"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<ul id="mwAwQ"><li id="mwAwU"><i id="mwAwY">The Death of Doctor Island</i>, 35<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwAwc"> </span>mm short, 2008.</li></ul>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="11" id="mwAwg" aria-labelledby="See_also"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="See_also">See also</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Gene_Wolfe&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11" title="Edit section: See also"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
